<p>Some of the computers offered in Ebay have had their hard drives
erased. No problem. I have seen DOS there for around $5 -- <A
href="http://search.ebay.com/search/search.dll?MfcISAPICommand=
GetResult&ht=1&SortProperty=MetaEndSort&query=ms-dos"> Ebay search for
MS-DOS</a>. Don't worry if you don't know how to use

DOS. You will learn enough to get by. Of course there's no need to get
DOS if the machine already has an operating system on it that will work.

